diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index d27f0be..2dcf567 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -191,6 +191,27 @@ chose.
 
 ---
 
+## Hebrew (עברית)
+
+```bash
+JARVIS_LANG=he npm start
+```
+
+The model answers in spoken Hebrew, the wake word also answers to "ג'רוויס", the
+browser recogniser listens for `he-IL`, Scribe is pinned to Hebrew, and the
+captions render right-to-left. Speech uses an installed Hebrew system voice, or
+ElevenLabs if a key is present (set `JARVIS_TTS_MODEL` to a model that supports
+Hebrew). Kokoro is English-only and is skipped. Hebrew recognition in the
+keyless browser mode depends on Chrome and is noticeably better with an
+ElevenLabs key.
+
+## Routing through a gateway (OmniRoute)
+
+Export `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`, `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` and `JARVIS_MODEL` in the
+shell that runs the bridge; the Agent SDK passes them to the `claude` process.
+
+---
+
 ## Controls
 
 | Key / phrase | Does |
